{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_title", "source_sha256": "475b19d69af3d90df960565a82ebc8a5236c3c7669383da227852df216f927b8", "ja": "絢爛と顕る伝説の来宴", "zh": "绚烂显现的传说来宴", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a70014d7382e0af52ec18f74196234c048eb80774778b5d11bd2aa5b3c464aa5", "ja": "突如劇場に現れた世界的アイドル玲音。\n765プロの噂を聞いて、詩花と共に劇場を\n訪れた彼女は、未来達の公演に触発され、\n自分の世界を劇場で披露すると言い出し\n即座にステージに上がるのだった。", "zh": "世界级偶像玲音突然现身剧场。\n听闻了765艺能的传闻，与诗花一同造访\n剧场的她受到未来等人的公演触动，\n提出要在剧场展现属于自己的世界，\n并当即登上了舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f002c68cae5864b31a374177d2b79dbbcebe231cb5e1cca853df559e990384d4", "ja": "（突然の玲音のステージは圧倒的だった。公演後は観客\nも未来達も、嵐に巻き込まれたような面持ちで……）", "zh": "（玲音突然登台，气势压倒性地惊人。演出结束后，无论是观众还是未来她们，脸上的神情都仿佛被卷入了暴风雨……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1001_201xxx", "source_sha256": "ad2879ea0dcd39c994673af5d2ae8315d19e8fd1416826deed69c27e39bdc62c", "ja": "お疲れ様でした、お姉さま！　またみんなを巻きこんで\n……どこか遠くまで連れて行っちゃいましたね。", "zh": "辛苦了，姐姐！又把大家卷入其中……带到很远的地方去了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1002_202xxx", "source_sha256": "dd9afe1327da6cf66056ff408437ff9c493d5e980710fe3e7501857c6ae77507", "ja": "ああ、トップギアのアタシを見せられたと思うな。\n{$P$}、ここは本当にいい劇場だね！", "zh": "啊，我想你已经见识到全力以赴的我了。\n{$P$}，这里真是个很棒的剧场啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f5330b948085d3320152d8ad22ae5caf80b692657e87fe611fe6d4bbd66633f9", "ja": "気に入ってもらえて嬉しいよ。少なくとも、\nウチの劇場は君を受け止められたってことかな。", "zh": "你能喜欢这里，我很高兴。至少，这说明我们的剧场接纳了你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1004_202xxx", "source_sha256": "4bb75371a0d4f616a7c33dedb8a51f41bde8919558b0655e66d9d582b9c9eea6", "ja": "それは間違いない、アタシが保証する。\nここはまだまだ、可能性がある場所だ。", "zh": "这点毫无疑问，我可以保证。这里依然是个充满可能性的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1005_202xxx", "source_sha256": "6cfebe46a98ee7b673317823b5f49d1c595761778412c99bbb93ee13550d51d9", "ja": "ええと……春日、最上、伊吹、だったね。\nキミ達はどうだった？　感想、聞かせて欲しいな。", "zh": "呃……你们是春日、最上和伊吹，对吧。\n你们觉得怎么样？我想听听你们的感想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fc52adac91d32c9be5c094571fc476fb4421367ee272a029f19f014b99265443", "ja": "え、え～と……。\nど、どうっていうか、その……。", "zh": "呃、呃～……。\n怎、怎么说呢，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1007_202xxx", "source_sha256": "39d9d96470f50b29a5165f8fed676c95e2e561fd4e725ac299d102920abacefe", "ja": "あれ？　たいしたことなかったかな？", "zh": "咦？没什么大不了的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "cccb5547a9bdc438f328a944b7f7d6c14840c89b70d96a82e94510265c059b1e", "ja": "そ、そんなことありません！　す、すごかったです……\nただ、圧倒されてしまって……なんて言えばいいか……", "zh": "才、才不是那样！很、很厉害的……\n只是被震撼到了……我、我该怎么说才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "362cf8de9aae35f6fce4e5eff573727aeb5beced39d2158afee99020994ebbad", "ja": "私、感動しました！　すっごく、\nすーっごく、かっこよかったです！", "zh": "我、我感动了！超级、\n超超级帅气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bed1857c03850dd41f55b9694192a21f73a4681efba8f6d1715b8444b97551c1", "ja": "あ、わたしもそんな感じかも。歌もダンスも超スゴくて\n～。TVで見たのより、ずーっとすごかったで～す♪", "zh": "啊，我可能也是这种感觉。歌和舞蹈都超级厉害——比在电视上看到的还要厉害得多～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1011_202xxx", "source_sha256": "d493b046bf3aeb8a073a3526edf55516d480e3229bb35066e8dce273f2a51593", "ja": "あははっ、ありがとう！　そうやって手放しで\n褒めてもらえるのは、アタシもうれしいよ。", "zh": "啊哈哈，谢谢！能听到你们这样毫不吝啬地\n夸赞，我也很高兴哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1012_202xxx", "source_sha256": "f83a6de22e093cd36093468cae2f21224b5e6df889c2eae32d0cd3e599ebcc54", "ja": "でも、それだけなら……期待外れかな。", "zh": "不过，如果只有这些的话……会让你失望吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1014_202xxx", "source_sha256": "b4fa5ecbd88e9c673d58727c3a241528cc7ec528ae65f8a97357ee4da517e61a", "ja": "壁は見上げているだけじゃ、決して越えられない。\nそもそも、越える気になれるかどうかが分かれ道だ。", "zh": "只是一味抬头仰望高墙，是绝不可能跨过去的。\n说到底，能不能下定决心去跨越，才是关键的分歧点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1015_202xxx", "source_sha256": "565d28a026a107b05c9f680f4453348c5213ece66e2323e1010374a6eaf71298", "ja": "春日、最上、伊吹。\nキミ達は、アタシを越えられると思ってる？", "zh": "春日、最上、伊吹。\n你们觉得，自己能超越我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1019_201xxx", "source_sha256": "baaefc669a251fedaeedea0e8020a84ba4105544dac1c2721db86f4c84651867", "ja": "また、もう。そんなこと、突然聞くなんて失礼です。\nごめんなさい、お姉さまはせっかちっていうか……。", "zh": "真是的，突然问这种问题太失礼了。\n对不起，姐姐她就是太性急了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "50c4deb0869a290eb7f07f2e76dfa5414ca081498dbe6ec68a866c995de1585d", "ja": "はい、なんとか！", "zh": "嗯，想办法做到啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1023_201xxx", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1024_p", "source_sha256": "7ed25de564af642a4d012e5d7a0338791ae083e1c0bd3253e1140b4ec29173ef", "ja": "み、未来？\nものすごく頼もしいけど……大丈夫か？", "zh": "未、未来？\n虽然非常靠得住……但没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "a93b5fa89afec5954b943c53e73a62947c89e73ad09cef011f737951f80f322e", "ja": "えー。だって静香ちゃんと翼もいるし、\n今日のライブもすっごく盛り上がりましたよね？", "zh": "诶——因为还有静香和翼在嘛，今天的演唱会也特别热闹，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "18adf486bc1e25dbd66b1f9370e26c5637d61867134ed1a70d0df6a5e756cfd1", "ja": "それに私たち、まだ中学生だし。玲音さんくらい大人に\nなる頃には、すごいことになってるかも！", "zh": "而且我们还都是初中生嘛。等我们长到玲音小姐那么成熟的时候，说不定已经变得不得了了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1027_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7350e6532c315f310c4359e006ad5764f28bcb684b5eb06c8b25338f6bed5d84", "ja": "あ～、そうだよね～！　わたしもこれからいっぱい成長\nする予定で～す！　ね、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "啊～，对哦～！我也打算从今以后不断成长～！对吧，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1028_p", "source_sha256": "91a14e06b28006113d9490bc46c3cb6adbdf2390f1ac67b9599ae9edc65beccc", "ja": "あ、ああ……、そうだな。\nとても楽しみだよ！", "zh": "啊、啊啊……是啊。\n我也非常期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1029_015siz", "source_sha256": "b57b03e8d0fc5ef3a83271675ea80109b32fad4daf97585509c59040d4ce4753", "ja": "わ、私だって……そうです。玲音さんのステージ、\nすごいって思ったのは……本当ですけど……。", "zh": "我、我也是……没错。觉得玲音小姐的舞台很厉害……这确实是真的，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "d322127ee6d0be3e4169ed55f70a6ff24820b968b203b538b649d6855f072718", "ja": "でも私、けっこう頑張れるタイプなんです！\nし、しかも、まだもっと頑張れるから……平気です！", "zh": "不过，我其实可是很能努力的类型！而、而且，我还能更加努力……所以没关系！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1031_202xxx", "source_sha256": "7f6cfca246215234a334debc3126cf22883ba1d4f16b4dc71cfb29cc3a7302d5", "ja": "……ふっ、ふふっ……そうか、そうだよね！\nうん、その通りだ！　気に入ったよ、キミ達！", "zh": "……呵、呵呵……是吗，说得也是呢！\n嗯，没错！我中意你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1032_202xxx", "source_sha256": "b5226e28cb57e5e0296ca89d1dbc9fd74c05337054b5e4b83b103f733ae25f68", "ja": "{$P$}、これ、アタシの連絡先ね。\n出演オファー、待ってるよ。", "zh": "{$P$}，这是我的联系方式。\n等着你们邀请我出演哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1033_p", "source_sha256": "2f4c1242d97878b5d4a1b6e79f2c96d914269c28caebf90c0f356bd76e3c9120", "ja": "えっ？　出演オファーって……もしかして、\nこれからも劇場に出演したいってことか？", "zh": "诶？出演邀约……难道说，你是想以后也继续来剧场演出吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1034_202xxx", "source_sha256": "c5d33485f9093153ccf8a636de3adda1e12eb7126d7f75d142f1bac36f566dbe", "ja": "言ったでしょ？　詩花と同じように接してくれって。\nそれとも、アタシだけのけ者にする気？", "zh": "我不是说过了吗？要像对待诗花那样对待我。还是说，你打算只把我排除在外？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "guest_001_after_202xxx_jp.gtx", "item_key": "guest_001_after_202xxx_1035_p", "source_sha256": "5c126432261391af4345fb82d89d4b09c3be4d9dc604dd9692a51352a89ca819", "ja": "いや、そんなつもりはないけど……というか、\n詩花と同じってそういう意味だったのか……。", "zh": "不，我倒没有那个意思……不过话说回来，\n和诗花一样原来是这个意思啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
